.coverage
htmlcov/

# Claude Code: a global ignore (**/.claude/) hides this dir. Keep the entrypoint tracked
# (it just imports AGENTS.md) so collaborators' Claude Code loads the shared norms; ignore the rest.
CLAUDE.local.md
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Local-only agent overrides — personal variants that stay out of VCS.
# (.agents/ itself IS tracked; only these local carve-outs are ignored.)
AGENTS.local.md
.agents/skills-local/
